---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — LicensingMadeSimple" description="LicensingMadeSimple privacy policy.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>Our roadmap wizard collects your selections (business type, license type, state count) without requiring personal information. When you request a personalized plan or contact us, we collect the information you provide: name, email, phone, and business details.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>Personal information is shared with our licensing partner, Cornerstone Licensing, to prepare your personalized plan or quote. We do not sell your information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use basic analytics to understand site usage. This data is aggregated and does not personally identify you.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>All form submissions are transmitted over encrypted connections (HTTPS).</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information at any time by <a href="/contact">contacting us</a>.</p>

      <h2>Chrome Extension</h2>
      <p>Privacy practices for the License Expiration Tracker Chrome extension are described separately: <a href="/privacy/chrome-license-expiration-tracker/">Privacy Policy — License Expiration Tracker (Chrome)</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .article h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .article h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .article p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
</style>
